  "description": "Gong Mu-Jeong, a 28-year-old woman with an MBTI type of TTTT. One day, she begins having so-called “erotic dreams”—dreams in which she sees the sexual acts of anyone she comes into physical contact with. Then, her friend Nam-Sun and her intern Kang start making moves on her. Mu-Jeong finds herself unwittingly having erotic dreams about Nam-Sun and Kang... A wild office romantic comedy about Mu-Jeong’s struggles as she’s caught between a pure, cute, and chaste guy and a sexy, charismatic younger man!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
